{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the florest in search of Blendkins, camouflaged animals that hides from people and help the nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fame of these curious and cute animals made people want to own then as pets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you catch a Blendkin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take care of one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blendkins will take you to explore this world and discover how to have your own, but pay attention, owning a Blendkin may have unforseen consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Blendkins!</strong> Fictional animals that blend in nature to hide, there will be 5 Blendkins in the final version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the forest!</strong> Explore the forest based off the Atlantic Forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care!</strong> Try to take care of Blendkins as pets and see how they live in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Starrygram!</strong> Starrygram, a fictional social media inside the game, can be explored and see what kind of post is a trend there.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917590?t=1755652958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917590?t=1755652958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917590/a036b4edb3bb4934b9ba2cccf4decceff4914e5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755652958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917590/a036b4edb3bb4934b9ba2cccf4decceff4914e5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755652958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the florest in search of Blendkins, camouflaged animals that hides from people and help the nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fame of these curious and cute animals made people want to own then as pets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do you catch a Blendkin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take care of one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blendkins will take you to explore this world and discover how to have your own, but pay attention, owning a Blendkin may have unforseen consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Blendkins!</strong> Fictional animals that blend in nature to hide, there will be 5 Blendkins in the final version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the forest!</strong> Explore the forest based off the Atlantic Forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take care!</strong> Try to take care of Blendkins as pets and see how they live in the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Starrygram!</strong> Starrygram, a fictional social media inside the game, can be explored and see what kind of post is a trend there.</p></li></ul>","developers":["TRINAC Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917590/cb96cca50336fcc524d28e2f3221106d8192baf0/header.jpg?t=1755652958","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 TRINAC LTDA. All rights reserved.","linux_r